        "description": {
          "value": "<p><strong>Working.</strong> <em>A bough that interrogates by judgment.</em></p>\n<p>A luminous bough extends from the bark toward one creature within near range. The target must speak the truest thing they fear; on a failed Resolve check (DC by tier), they take 3d6 sephirotic damage to Stress and are Calmed for one exchange while the tree weighs the answer.</p>\n<p><strong>Cost.</strong> 2 Clarity, +1 Noise · action · single / near.</p>\n<p><em>Bark grows over the wound and sings hymns until they answer.</em></p>"
